  kind: 10
  description: 'A propellant depot at Jovara''s trailing Lagrange point, L5, 60 degrees behind the planet in its orbit and going round with it. L4 and L5 are stable: the depot swings slowly round the point and stays (the Trojan rocks gather at the leading point, L4). Dock here (K) for repairs and to sell ore.'
